{"title": "Idol of Silvanus", "pageid": 4129, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Idol_of_Silvanus", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the item. For how to acquire it, see <a href=\"/wiki/Steal_the_Sacred_Idol\" title=\"Steal the Sacred Idol\">Steal the Sacred Idol</a>.   </div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png/300px-Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/5/5a/Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Idol of Silvanus image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png/300px-Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Idol_of_Silvanus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Idol of Silvanus</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item the druids of the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a> are using to conduct the <b>Rite of Thorns</b>, a ritual which will cut off the grove from the rest of the world.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A wooden statue of <a href=\"/wiki/Silvanus\" title=\"Silvanus\">Silvanus</a>, the Oak Father, god of nature and its impartial fairness. Those near the idol seem to better understand the natural world.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 350 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  350  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-44b53691bd66ff0cEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">bd8795e9-7daa-4d92-bac4-93f5dd8f66b2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bd8795e9-7daa-4d92-bac4-93f5dd8f66b2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:bd8795e9-7daa-4d92-bac4-93f5dd8f66b2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>When held in a party member's inventory, that character and all characters nearby receive <b>Silvanus' Blessing</b>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Idyllic_Aura\"> Condition: Idyllic Aura </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Idyllic_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Idyllic Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Idyllic Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Idyllic_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Idyllic Aura (Condition)\">Idyllic Aura</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Grants Silvanus' Blessing to creatures within range.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> <h2><span id=\"Condition:_Silvanus.27_Blessing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Silvanus'_Blessing\"> Condition: Silvanus' Blessing </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silvanus%27_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvanus' Blessing (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silvanus' Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Silvanus%27_Blessing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silvanus%27_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvanus' Blessing (Condition)\">Silvanus' Blessing</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;8 m (27 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;8 m (27 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\">Animal Handling</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the Sacred Pool of the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid_Grove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Druid Grove\">Druid Grove</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;241&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;510</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is a key component in the <a href=\"/wiki/Rite_of_Thorns_(ritual)\" title=\"Rite of Thorns (ritual)\">Rite of Thorns</a>, and stealing or even touching it without first ending the rite triggers <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove/Combat\" title=\"Emerald Grove/Combat\">combat between the Druids and Tieflings</a>.</li>\n<li>Stealing this item grants the inspiration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Criminal#Heretic\" title=\"Criminal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heretic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Criminal#Heretic\" title=\"Criminal\">Heretic</a> to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Criminal\" title=\"Criminal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Background_Criminal_Icon.png/20px-Background_Criminal_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Background_Criminal_Icon.png/30px-Background_Criminal_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Background_Criminal_Icon.png/40px-Background_Criminal_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Criminal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Background_Criminal_Icon.png/20px-Background_Criminal_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Background_Criminal_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Criminal\" title=\"Criminal\">Criminal</a> background.</li>\n<li>Although arguably meeting all the criteria of a quest item and important to the game's story, this item is tagged in-game as \"common\".</li>\n<li>Similar to the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resonance_Stone\" title=\"Resonance Stone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Resonance_Stone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resonance_Stone\" title=\"Resonance Stone\">Resonance Stone</a>, the aura generated by this item affects all entities within its radius.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steal_the_Sacred_Idol\" title=\"Steal the Sacred Idol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Steal the Sacred Idol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Steal_the_Sacred_Idol\" title=\"Steal the Sacred Idol\">Steal the Sacred Idol</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_literature\">Related literature</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grove_Artefacts\" title=\"Grove Artefacts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grove_Artefacts\" title=\"Grove Artefacts\">Grove Artefacts</a></span></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195318\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.084 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3527/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38576/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9920/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1302430/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion tim